<title>BRAZIL: Brazil expects to resume CVRD sale later.</title>
<headline>Brazil expects to resume CVRD sale later.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's National Development Bank (BNDES) expects to overturn a new injunction and resume the auction of mining giant Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD) later Tuesday, an official said.</p>
<p>Tereza Cristina Aquino, BNDES privatization superintendent, said the bidding for one of the world's largest iron ore exporters would resume with the last bid made before the court order brought the auction to an abrupt and dramatic halt.</p>
</text>
